      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would be cool to see a feature like this. Like in non-public instances the instance owner can (globally) mute and kick players in that instance. So the instance owner should be able to give another player (instance) moderator rights so they can also mute and kick people from the instance",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
