  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-30T22:26:33.132Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My friend plays and streams music in Vrchat and it would be useful if I could be given the ability to mute or block someone harassing him in the middle of his song, since he's not able to use his mouse at that moment.  \nAllow someone to be a sort of a moderator for another user.",
